id: focus-chain
title: Focus Chain (automatic N-turn todo-list re-injection)
section: 6
subsystem: Focus Chain (ADR-0204)
order: 204
maturity: L3
status: stable
ui_surfaces: [n-a]
monitoring: n-a
modes: [interactive, headless, batch, daemon, ide, ci-bot]
configurable: n-a
owners: ["@songmin"]
labels: ["surface:core", "tier:1", "absorbed:cline"]
depends_on: []
purpose: |
  Cline absorption: every N turns (default 6) auto-splice the current todo
  list into the next prompt as a `## Focus Chain — Todos` markdown block so a
  long-running autonomous session doesn't lose the multi-step plan when it
  ages out of context. Drift detector: N turns of zero todo activity
  (no markDone / no setTodos) surfaces a one-line warning the host may add
  to the next `<system-reminder>`. Distinct from ADR-0045 (progress-audit
  skill, user-invocable) — Focus Chain is AUTOMATIC. Pure in-memory
  state machine: setTodos / tickTurn / getInjection (consuming) /
  peekInjection (non-consuming) / getDriftWarning / markDone /
  snapshotTodos / currentTurn. NO-THROW on every method. Default-OFF:
  loop never constructs a tracker; host opt-in via AgentConfig slot.
  Byte-identical when absent.
evidence:
  code:
    - src/agent/focus-chain/port.ts
    - src/agent/focus-chain/todo-injector.ts
    - src/agent/focus-chain/drift-detector.ts
    - src/agent/focus-chain/default-tracker.ts
    - src/agent/focus-chain/index.ts
  adrs: [204]
  tests:
    unit:
      - tests/unit/focus-chain-hellgate.test.ts
    integration: []
    contract: []
knobs: []
deliberate_hold: null
notes: |
  Knobs: reinjectEveryN (default 6 Cline operational value; 0 = explicit
  disable; negative/NaN = fallback default), driftWindowTurns (default 5;
  same null-on-bad-input rule). First injection NEVER on turn 0 (model
  just saw todos at session start; waits one full cycle). Drift on empty
  todo list returns null (not actionable). Pure markdown output; host
  decides splice site (system prompt / per-turn reminder / elsewhere).
  Single-session — sharing across forks would corrupt the counter.
